====Usage notes====
* After verbs the pronoun {{m|is|þú}} is either:
*: separated:
*:: {{qualifier|separated}} {{ux|is|munt '''þú'''|inline=1|are '''you''' going to}}
*:: {{qualifier|separated}} {{ux|is|skalt '''þú'''|inline=1|'''you''' shall}}
*:: {{qualifier|separated}} {{ux|is|borðar '''þú'''|inline=1|do '''you''' eat}}
*:: {{qualifier|separated}} {{ux|is|hoppar '''þú'''|inline=1|do '''you''' jump}}
*:: {{qualifier|separated}} {{ux|is|sérð '''þú'''|inline=1|do '''you''' see}}
*: or suffixed and changed into {{m|is|-ðu}}, {{m|is|-du}}, {{m|is|-tu}} or {{m|is|-u}}:
*:: {{qualifier|suffixed}} {{ux|is|mun'''tu'''|inline=1|are '''you''' going to}}
*:: {{qualifier|suffixed}} {{ux|is|borðar'''ðu'''|inline=1|do '''you''' eat}}
*:: {{qualifier|suffixed}} {{ux|is|vil'''tu'''|inline=1|do '''you''' want to}}
*:: {{qualifier|suffixed}} {{ux|is|nennir'''ðu'''|inline=1|could '''you''' be bothered to}}

